Eduka-Default is the Orchis GTK theme (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Orchis-theme,
teal accent, light colors, standard size) by vinceliuice, built with its
install.sh (sassc) and renamed for Edukasaun OS. Licensed under the GNU GPL
version 3 (see COPYING). The xfwm4 and openbox-3 window borders are generated
by tools/gen-wm-themes.py with the same colors.
